", \\\\\\\"ar\\\\\\\"]}}\\\"}}]\\n17:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"script\\\",\\\"4\\\",{\\\"type\\\":\\\"application/ld+json\\\",\\\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\\\":{\\\"__html\\\":\\\"{\\\\\\\"@context\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"https://schema.org\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"@type\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"LocalBusiness\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"@id\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"https://brightluxx.com/#localbusiness\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"name\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Brightluxx LED Displays\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"image\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"url\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"https://brightluxx.com\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"telephone\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"+971559954274\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"priceRange\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"AED 2,500 - AED 12,000 per m\\\\\\\\u00b2\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"address\\\\\\\": {\\\\\\\"@type\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"PostalAddress\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"streetAddress\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"addressLocality\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Dubai\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"addressCountry\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"AE\\\\\\\"}, \\\\\\\"geo\\\\\\\": {\\\\\\\"@type\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"GeoCoordinates\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"latitude\\\\\\\": 24.9857, \\\\\\\"longitude\\\\\\\": 55.0272}, \\\\\\\"openingHoursSpecification\\\\\\\": {\\\\\\\"@type\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"OpeningHoursSpecification\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"dayOfWeek\\\\\\\": [\\\\\\\"Monday\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Tuesday\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Wednesday\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Thursday\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Friday\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Saturday\\\\\\\"], \\\\\\\"opens\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"09:00\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"closes\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"18:00\\\\\\\"}, \\\\\\\"areaServed\\\\\\\": [\\\\\\\"Dubai\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Abu Dhabi\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"United Arab Emirates\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Saudi Arabia\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Qatar\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Kuwait\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Bahrain\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"Oman\\\\\\\"]}\\\"}}]\\n19:T7e2,\\u003ch1\\u003eCinemaLED Pro 0.9mm\\u003c/h1\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eExperience CinemaLED Pro 0.9mm micro-LED displays in Dubai. Perfect for cinematic visuals. Contact Brightluxx for top UAE LED solutions!\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eDCI-P3. 4K HDR. The projector killer.\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eDCI-certified cinema LED screen replacing traditional projectors. 0.9mm COB pitch delivers 4K resolution on screens up to 14 metres wide. 500-nit peak brightness with infinite contrast ratio eliminates the need for controlled lighting. Supports DCI-P3 color gamut and Dolby Vision.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch2\\u003eFAQ\\u003c/h2\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003eWhat makes CinemaLED Pro 0.9mm better than traditional cinema projectors?\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eCinemaLED Pro 0.9mm delivers true 4K resolution with a 0.93mm pixel pitch and infinite contrast ratio, producing true blacks without any light leakage. It also supports DCI-P3 98% color gamut and Dolby Vision HDR for superior image quality, eliminating the issues of projector bulb dimming and ambient light interference.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003eWhat are the installation requirements for this cinema LED screen?\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eThe CinemaLED Pro 0.9mm supports screen widths up to 14 meters and requires a structurally sound mounting surface with access to power and data connections. Its perforated design allows integration with behind-screen audio systems, ensuring seamless setup in new or existing cinema environments.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003eHow does the brightness of 500 nits impact viewing in different lighting conditions?\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eWith a peak brightness of 500 nits and infinite contrast, the CinemaLED Pro produces vivid and bright images visible even in non-controlled ambient lighting. This reduces the need for strict light control in theaters, enhancing viewer comfort and flexibility.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003ch3\\u003eWhat warranty and support options are available for this product?\\u003c/h3\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eBrightluxx offers a comprehensive warranty for CinemaLED Pro, typically covering 3 to 5 years depending on purchase terms. Dedicated technical support is available to assist with installation, calibration, and ongoing maintenance ensuring optimal performance.\\u003c/p\\u003e18:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\\\":{\\\"__html\\\":\\\"$19\\\"}}]\\nf:[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"meta\\\",\\\"0\\\",{\\\"charSet\\\":\\\"utf-8\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"meta\\\",\\\"1\\\",{\\\"name\\\":\\\"viewport\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\\\"}]]\\nc:null\\n11:[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"title\\\",\\\"0\\\",{\\\"children\\\":\\\"CinemaLED Pro 0.9mm Micro-LED Display Dubai | Brightluxx UAE\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"meta\\\",\\\"1\\\",{\\\"name\\\":\\\"description\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"Experience CinemaLED Pro 0.9mm micro-LED displays in Dubai. Perfect for cinematic visuals. Contact Brightluxx for top UAE LED solutions!\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"link\\\",\\\"2\\\",{\\\"rel\\\":\\\"canonical\\\",\\\"href\\\":\\\"https://brightluxx.com/products/bl-cnx093\\\"}]]\\n\"])</script></body></html>","rsc":"1:\"$Sreact.fragment\"\n2:I[31262,[\"/_next/static/chunks/3ai24x07kh91w.js\"],\"PageViewTracker\"]\n3:I[48303,[\"/_next/static/chunks/3ai24x07kh91w.js\"],\"SiteHeader\"]\n4:I[39756,[\"/_next/static/chunks/3ai24x07kh91w.js\"],\"default\"]\n5:I[37457,[\"/_next/static/chunks/3ai24x07kh91w.js\"],\"default\"]\n6:I[22016,[\"/_next/static/chunks/3ai24x07kh91w.js\"],\"\"]\n7:I[52006,[\"/_next/static/chunks/3ai24x07kh91w.js\"],\"FloatingActions\"]\n8:I[81888,[\"/_next/static/chunks/3ai24x07kh91w.js\"],\"CookieConsent\"]\na:I[97367,[\"/_next/static/chunks/3ai24x07kh91w.js\"],\"OutletBoundary\"]\nb:\"$Sreact.suspense\"\ne:I[97367,[\"/_next/static/chunks/3ai24x07kh91w.js\"],\"ViewportBoundary\"]\n10:I[97367,[\"/_next/static/chunks/3ai24x07kh91w.js\"],\"MetadataBoundary\"]\n12:I[68027,[\"/_next/static/chunks/3ai24x07kh91w.js\"],\"default\",1]\n:HL[\"/_next/static/chunks/0glh4djm8_vrx.css\",\"style\"]\n:HL[\"https://files.ihgbrands.com/assets_brightluxx-logo-nav.png\",\"image\"]\nd:X\n0:{\"P\":null,\"c\":[\"\",\"products\",\"bl-cnx09