lution with a 0.93mm pixel pitch and infinite contrast ratio, producing true blacks without any light leakage. It also supports DCI-P3 98% color gamut and Dolby Vision HDR for superior image quality, eliminating the issues of projector bulb dimming and ambient light interference.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What are the installation requirements for this cinema LED screen?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The CinemaLED Pro 0.9mm supports screen widths up to 14 meters and requires a structurally sound mounting surface with access to power and data connections. Its perforated design allows integration with behind-screen audio systems, ensuring seamless setup in new or existing cinema environments.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How does the brightness of 500 nits impact viewing in different lighting conditions?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"With a peak brightness of 500 nits and infinite contrast, the CinemaLED Pro produces vivid and bright images visible even in non-controlled ambient lighting. This reduces the need for strict light control in theaters, enhancing viewer comfort and flexibility.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What warranty and support options are available for this product?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Brightluxx offers a comprehensive warranty for CinemaLED Pro, typically covering 3 to 5 years depending on purchase terms. Dedicated technical support is available to assist with installation, calibration, and ongoing maintenance ensuring optimal performance.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How does the CinemaLED Pro compare to other cinema LED displays on the market?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"CinemaLED Pro 0.9mm stands out with its ultra-fine 0.93mm pixel pitch delivering native DCI 4K resolution, high brightness, and HDR capabilities. Its COB Micro LED technology provides superior reliability and contrast compared to traditional LED panels that may have visible pixels or lower contrast ratios.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Is this product suitable for both commercial theaters and private screening rooms?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Yes, its flexible screen width up to 14 meters and perforated design for behind-screen speakers make it ideal for large commercial cinemas and intimate private screening rooms, providing premium cinematic experiences regardless of venue size.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What certification does CinemaLED Pro have to ensure cinema quality standards?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"CinemaLED Pro 0.9mm is certified by DCI (Digital Cinema Initiatives) and TPC, ensuring it meets stringent quality and performance standards required for professional cinema environments.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What kind of audio integration does the CinemaLED Pro support?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The screen is perforated to allow sound to pass through, enabling seamless integration with behind-screen speaker systems commonly used in cinemas for immersive audio without compromising visual quality.\"}}]}a:X\nf:X\nf:C\n0:{\"buildId\":\"d59rBE55FstXJAjtgGQzt\",\"data\":[{\"rsc\":[\"$\",\"$1\",\"c\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"main\",null,{\"data-testid\":\"next-server-rendered-parity-page\",\"children\":[[[\"$\",\"script\",\"0\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$2\"}}],[\"$\",\"script\",\"1\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$3\"}}],\"$L4\",\"$L5\",\"$L6\"],\"$L7\"]}],null,\"$L8\"]}],\"isPartial\":\"$@9\",\"staleTime\":\"$a\",\"varyParams\":null},{\"rsc\":\"$Lb\",\"isPartial\":\"$@c\",\"staleTime\":\"$a\",\"varyParams\":null},{\"rsc\":\"$Ld\",\"isPartial\":\"$@e\",\"staleTime\":\"$a\",\"varyParams\":\"$f\"},{\"rsc\":\"$L10\",\"isPa