, \\\"legalName\\\": \\\"Brightluxx LED Displays\\\", \\\"url\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com\\\", \\\"logo\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\\\", \\\"telephone\\\": \\\"+971559954274\\\", \\\"address\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"PostalAddress\\\", \\\"streetAddress\\\": \\\"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\\\", \\\"addressLocality\\\": \\\"Dubai\\\", \\\"addressCountry\\\": \\\"AE\\\"}, \\\"contactPoint\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"ContactPoint\\\", \\\"telephone\\\": \\\"+971559954274\\\", \\\"contactType\\\": \\\"sales\\\", \\\"areaServed\\\": [\\\"AE\\\", \\\"SA\\\", \\\"QA\\\", \\\"KW\\\", \\\"BH\\\", \\\"OM\\\"], \\\"availableLanguage\\\": [\\\"en\\\", \\\"ar\\\"]}}\"}}]\n6:[\"$\",\"script\",\"4\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\": \\\"https://schema.org\\\", \\\"@type\\\": \\\"LocalBusiness\\\", \\\"@id\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/#localbusiness\\\", \\\"name\\\": \\\"Brightluxx LED Displays\\\", \\\"image\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\\\", \\\"url\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com\\\", \\\"telephone\\\": \\\"+971559954274\\\", \\\"priceRange\\\": \\\"AED 2,500 - AED 12,000 per m\\\\u00b2\\\", \\\"address\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"PostalAddress\\\", \\\"streetAddress\\\": \\\"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\\\", \\\"addressLocality\\\": \\\"Dubai\\\", \\\"addressCountry\\\": \\\"AE\\\"}, \\\"geo\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"GeoCoordinates\\\", \\\"latitude\\\": 24.9857, \\\"longitude\\\": 55.0272}, \\\"openingHoursSpecification\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"OpeningHoursSpecification\\\", \\\"dayOfWeek\\\": [\\\"Monday\\\", \\\"Tuesday\\\", \\\"Wednesday\\\", \\\"Thursday\\\", \\\"Friday\\\", \\\"Saturday\\\"], \\\"opens\\\": \\\"09:00\\\", \\\"closes\\\": \\\"18:00\\\"}, \\\"areaServed\\\": [\\\"Dubai\\\", \\\"Abu Dhabi\\\", \\\"United Arab Emirates\\\", \\\"Saudi Arabia\\\", \\\"Qatar\\\", \\\"Kuwait\\\", \\\"Bahrain\\\", \\\"Oman\\\"]}\"}}]\n14:T7e2,<h1>CinemaLED Pro 0.9mm</h1><p>Experience CinemaLED Pro 0.9mm micro-LED displays in Dubai. Perfect for cinematic visuals. Contact Brightluxx for top UAE LED solutions!</p><p><strong>DCI-P3. 4K HDR. The projector killer.</strong></p><p>DCI-certified cinema LED screen replacing traditional projectors. 0.9mm COB pitch delivers 4K resolution on screens up to 14 metres wide. 500-nit peak brightness with infinite contrast ratio eliminates the need for controlled lighting. Supports DCI-P3 color gamut and Dolby Vision.</p><h2>FAQ</h2><h3>What makes CinemaLED Pro 0.9mm better than traditional cinema projectors?</h3><p>CinemaLED Pro 0.9mm delivers true 4K resolution with a 0.93mm pixel pitch and infinite contrast ratio, producing true blacks without any light leakage. It also supports DCI-P3 98% color gamut and Dolby Vision HDR for superior image quality, eliminating the issues of projector bulb dimming and ambient light interference.</p><h3>What are the installation requirements for this cinema LED screen?</h3><p>The CinemaLED Pro 0.9mm supports screen widths up to 14 meters and requires a structurally sound mounting surface with access to power and data connections. Its perforated design allows integration with behind-screen audio systems, ensuring seamless setup in new or existing cinema environments.</p><h3>How does the brightness of 500 nits impact viewing in different lighting conditions?</h3><p>With a peak brightness of 500 nits and infinite contrast, the CinemaLED Pro produces vivid and bright images visible even in non-controlled ambient lighting. This reduces the need for strict light control in theaters, enhancing viewer comfort and flexibility.</p><h3>What warranty and support options are available for this product?</h3><p>Brightluxx offers a comprehensive warranty for CinemaLED Pro, typically covering 3 to 5 years depending on purchase terms. Dedicated technical support is available to assist with installation, calibration, and ongoing maintenance ensuring optimal performance.</p>7: